{
  "about": "One pricing matrix for venue food orders, asserted by BOTH sides: priceFoodCart in @duncit/utils (what the guest is shown) and foodTotals / placeVenueFoodOrder on the server (what is charged). A case that passes on one side and fails on the other is a guest being quoted a price they are not charged. GST meets the net (subtotal less both discounts), rounded half up to a paisa: INCLUSIVE taxable = round(net x 100 / (100 + pct)) and tax = net - taxable; EXCLUSIVE taxable = net and tax = round(net x pct / 100). total = taxable + tax. below_minimum is judged on the net, before GST.",
